    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100550" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνηρετ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>work with, assist, befriend</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1329
			</span></i> (as Lob. from <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνηρετίσεις: συνήσεις,
			συζυγήσεις</span>) for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνηρετμεῖν</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἆρ᾽ ὄλβος
				αὐτοῖς . . ξυνηρετεῖ</span>; <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				776
			</span></i> (prob. cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνηρεφεῖ</span>
			codd. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. τύχαις</span>
			<i>adapt oneself</i> to . ., ib.<i><span class="en">
				282.7
			</span></i> (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἀξυπηρετεῖν</span> (codd. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i>) may be right).</div>
